Catalogue Number: Population 2019/2                           Released 30 th August 2019 
 
POPULATION AND VITAL STATISTICS 
MID YEAR POPULATION ESTIMATES 2019 
The population of Seychelles stood at 97, 625 at 30 th June 2019, indicating a growth rate of 0.9% 
over 2018.  In mid-2019, there were 49,665 males and 47,960 females or an approximate ratio of 
1,036 men for every 1,000 women. There were 808 registered live births and 382 registered deaths 
for the first six months of 2019.   
  
